9:["$","div",null,{"className":"frame-1200 py-100 sm-pt-0 sm-pb-50 sm-px-20","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-center sm-text-start mb-50 sm-mb-20","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"mb-20","children":"Portfolio Website Design Cost Breakdown"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Select the best portfolio website design and Development package based on the ",["$","br",null,{}],"features, performance, and growth level you need."]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"CostCalculator-module__QralSq__chart","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"CostCalculator-module__QralSq__grid","children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Web Design Solution"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Benefits"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Price Range Estimate"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"CostCalculator-module__QralSq__grid","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"Basic"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Affordable, creative"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"CostCalculator-module__QralSq__price","children":"AED 3,000- 5,000"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"CostCalculator-module__QralSq__grid","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"Standard"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Feature-rich, creative"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"CostCalculator-module__QralSq__price","children":"AED 5,000- 8,000"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"CostCalculator-module__QralSq__grid","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"Advanced"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Well-structured, growth-ready"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"CostCalculator-module__QralSq__price","children":"AED 8,000- 12,000"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"CostCalculator-module__QralSq__grid","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"Premium"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Premium, custom-built"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"CostCalculator-module__QralSq__price","children":"AED 12,000+"}]]}]]}]]}]
a:["$","$L1b",null,{"heding":"Our Website Development Process","subheding":"Every personal branding journey is unique, and so is our process. Website Development Agency, we apply the mix of creativity, technology, and strategy to forge a website that shows your uniqueness and delivers your worth exactly.","processData":[{"id":"01","title":"Discovery & Consultation","description":"Based on information about your goals, story, profession, and audience expectations, we define the creative direction, and tone for your brand."},{"id":"02","title":"Website Artchitecture","description":"We take your achievements, case studies, and highlights and shape them into a convincing narrative that attracts visitors while mirroring your professional values."},{"id":"03","title":"Design & Development","description":"We build the identity of your business with the help of the latest technology and our visually captivating and mobile-first designs ensure the best user experience and functionality."},{"id":"04","title":"Integration","description":"Social media APIs, videos, and portfolio tools are some of the elements that we integrate to boost your online presence and engagement."},{"id":"05","title":"Testing & QA","description":"Prior to launch, the Website Development Agency team will conduct meticulous performance, usability and security testing. We will identify bugs and browser compatibility, while also ensuring a fast-loading site for the best user experience."},{"id":"06","title":"Launch & Optimization","description":"Your website goes live only after SEO audits, analytics setup, and speed optimization. We also implement conversion tracking tools to measure performance from day one."},{"id":"07","title":"Support & Maintenance","description":"Our partnership doesn’t end at launch. We offer ongoing monitoring, updates, and feature enhancements to ensure your website is operating efficiently and dynamic enough to adapt to market changes."}]}]
1c:T4d0,<p>We don't just build tech-savvy websites but also, and most importantly, the visual storytelling, the user experience, and the lasting impact of your site. Every feature of your website represents you authentically, from the character of the voice to the visual design of it, everything is tweaked carefully to fit you. In this manner, our expertise includes consultants, artists, public speakers, authors, and entrepreneurs, which enables us to draw from a wide pool of creative thoughts for every new idea.</p>
                                <p>From portfolio integration and media showcases to SEO-driven architecture and responsive design, every detail is optimized to elevate your visibility and influence online. We don’t just help you create a personal brand; we help you build a digital legacy that continues to grow with you.</p>
                                <p>Transparency is a key component of our process. We will share straightforward pricing, clear timelines and assign you a project manager to provide ongoing communication. This way, you will always be updated on the work on your website, and you can focus on scaling your business while we take care of the technical side.</p>
                            b:["$","div",null,{"className":"frame-1200 py-100 sm-pt-0 sm-pb-50 sm-px-20","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"CommonWhyWebsiteDevelopment-module__smXB6a__flex","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"CommonWhyWebsiteDevelopment-module__smXB6a__left","children":["$","h2",null,{"children":"Why Choose Website Development Agency for Ecommerce Website Development"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"CommonWhyWebsiteDevelopment-module__smXB6a__right","children":["$","p",null,{"children":"Picking the right partner to work on your personal website is undoubtedly an essential decision. Website Development Agency is where we integrate imagination, strategies, and technology into the layouts that are not only your own but also work at a high level. Our ambition is not simply to construct a website, but to forge a digital journey that is your signature and extends your reach."}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"CommonWhyWebsiteDevelopment-module__smXB6a__flex CommonWhyWebsiteDevelopment-module__smXB6a__bottom","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"CommonWhyWebsiteDevelopment-module__smXB6a__left","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$1c"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"CommonWhyWebsiteDevelopment-module__smXB6a__right","children":["$","$L3",null,{"src":{"src":"/_next/static/media/why-choose-wd-agency.bf8ad1f9.webp","width":1256,"height":1140,"blurWidth":8,"blurHeight":7,"blurDataURL":"data:image/webp;base64,"},"alt":"Why Website Development"}]}]]}]]}]
